 "qualifications": [
  "Abort removes the registration matching type, listener and capture. Measured Chromium also removes a listener removed and re-added before the abort; the native facade matches that.",
  "Custom reasons reuse the H02 TimingDetail payload, copied on abort. Object and Array payloads keep their instance across reads and composites; Text, Number and Boolean are values.",
  "Native timeouts run on host Cycle; the shared fixture uses only zero and 1e9 ms timeouts and never waits on wall-clock time.",
  "Browser statics the realm lacks raise NotSupportedException and report Unknown capability facts; Chromium defines abort, timeout and any.",
  "Abort-callback exceptions are reported to host.Errors on native and to the realm on Chromium; the shared fixture does not throw from callbacks.",
  "View onCleanup integration is a possible follow-up and is not part of this group.",
  "Only win-x64 is exercised; official packages, other RIDs and traced builds remain acceptance gates."
 ]
